## At work

- easy access to a toilet, and toilet breaks when needed
- time off for appointments and procedures. Most people need a few weeks to recover after TURP

## Is it a disability?

An enlarged prostate is not usually severe enough to count as a disability under the Equality Act, but it can be if it has a substantial, long-term effect on daily life.

## Benefits

An enlarged prostate on its own does not usually qualify for disability benefits.

## Prescriptions

In England, a **prescription prepayment certificate** can save money if you take regular medicines. Men aged **60 and over** get free prescriptions in England. Prescriptions are free for everyone in Wales.
